                       = 3.14 * 38* 38 * 35
                       = 146300.000000
</pre></div><p><a href="program-to-calculate-the-cgpa-percentage">10) Program to calculate the CGPA percentage</a></p><p>CGPA percentage is = (float)(9.5 * (CGPA));</p><p><strong>Input:</strong></p><div class="codeblock"><div class="dp-highlighter"><div class="bar"><div class="tools"> </div></div><ol class="dp-xml" start="1"><li class="alt"><span><span class="attribute">CGPA</span><span> = (Grades in all Subjects) / (Total Number of Subjects).  </span></span></li><li><span><span class="attribute">English</span><span> = </span><span class="attribute-value">9</span><span>.1;  </span></span></li><li class="alt"><span><span class="attribute">Hindi</span><span> = </span><span class="attribute-value">8</span><span>.5;  </span></span></li><li><span><span class="attribute">Maths</span><span> = </span><span class="attribute-value">9</span><span>.5;  </span></span></li><li class="alt"><span><span class="attribute">Science</span><span> =</span><span class="attribute-value">9</span><span>.6;  </span></span></li><li><span><span class="attribute">SocialStudy</span><span> = </span><span class="attribute-value">8</span><span>.6;  </span></span></li><li class="alt"><span><span class="attribute">CGPA</span><span> = (9.1+8.5+9.5+9.6+8.6)/(5.0);  </span></span></li></ol></div><textarea class="xml" name="code" style="display:none">CGPA = (Grades in all Subjects) / (Total Number of Subjects).
