</textarea></div><p><strong>Output:</strong></p><div class="codeblock3"><pre>
CGPA percentage is = 86.070000
</pre></div><p><a href="program-to-convert-celsius-into-fahrenheit">11) Program to convert Celsius into Fahrenheit</a></p><p>Temperature in Fahrenheit = ((celsius * 9) / 5) + 32</p><p><strong>Input:</strong></p><div class="codeblock"><div class="dp-highlighter"><div class="bar"><div class="tools"> </div></div><ol class="dp-xml" start="1"><li class="alt"><span><span class="attribute">celsius</span><span>= </span><span class="attribute-value">12</span><span>  </span></span></li></ol></div><textarea class="xml" name="code" style="display:none">celsius= 12
