</pre></div><p><a href="program-to-find-the-surface-area-of-the-cylinder">21) Program to find the surface area of the cylinder</a></p><img alt="Program to find the surface area of the cylinder" src="https://d2jdgazzki9vjm.cloudfront.net/programs/images/surface-area-of-the-cylinder-basic-programs.png"><p>Surface Area of Cylinder = 2 Π (r + h)</p><p><strong>Input:</strong></p><div class="codeblock"><div class="dp-highlighter"><div class="bar"><div class="tools"> </div></div><ol class="dp-xml" start="1"><li class="alt"><span><span class="attribute">r</span><span> = </span><span class="attribute-value">2</span><span>.0, </span><span class="attribute">h</span><span> = </span><span class="attribute-value">5</span><span>.0   </span></span></li></ol></div><textarea class="xml" name="code" style="display:none">r = 2.0, h = 5.0 
