Here, r = radius, h = height, and Π ( pie ) = 3.14
        = 2 * 3.14 * ( 2.0 + 5.0)
        = 44.00000
</pre></div><hr/><h2 class="h2padding" id="number">Number Programs</h2><p><a href="program-to-check-disarium-number">1) Program to Check Disarium number</a></p><p><strong>Input:</strong></p><div class="codeblock"><div class="dp-highlighter"><div class="bar"><div class="tools"> </div></div><ol class="dp-xml" start="1"><li class="alt"><span><span class="attribute">num</span><span> = </span><span class="attribute-value">175</span><span>  </span></span></li></ol></div><textarea class="xml" name="code" style="display:none">num = 175
</textarea></div><p><strong>Output:</strong></p><div class="codeblock3"><pre>
1<sup>1</sup> + 7<sup>2</sup> + 5<sup>3</sup> = 1 + 49 + 125 = 175
175 is a disarium number
</pre></div><p><a href="program-to-check-happy-number">2) Program to Check Happy number</a></p><p><strong>Input:</strong></p><div class="codeblock"><div class="dp-highlighter"><div class="bar"><div class="tools"> </div></div><ol class="dp-xml" start="1"><li class="alt"><span><span class="attribute">num</span><span> = </span><span class="attribute-value">82</span><span>  </span></span></li></ol></div><textarea class="xml" name="code" style="display:none">num = 82
