82 is a happy number number
</pre></div><p><a href="program-to-check-harshad-number">3) Program to Check Harshad number</a></p><p>A number is said to be the Harshad number if it is divisible by the sum of its digit.</p><p><strong>Input:</strong></p><div class="codeblock"><div class="dp-highlighter"><div class="bar"><div class="tools"> </div></div><ol class="dp-xml" start="1"><li class="alt"><span><span class="attribute">num</span><span> = </span><span class="attribute-value">156</span><span>  </span></span></li></ol></div><textarea class="xml" name="code" style="display:none">num = 156
