156 is a Harshad number
</pre></div><p><a href="program-to-print-all-disarium-numbers-between-1-to-100">4) Program to print all Disarium numbers between 1 to 100</a></p><p><strong>Input:</strong></p><div class="codeblock"><div class="dp-highlighter"><div class="bar"><div class="tools"> </div></div><ol class="dp-xml" start="1"><li class="alt"><span><span>range(1, 101)  </span></span></li></ol></div><textarea class="xml" name="code" style="display:none">range(1, 101)
