           [4, 5, 6]
           [1, 2, 3]
 
matrix b = [1, 1, 1]
           [2, 3, 1]
           [1, 5, 1]
</textarea></div><p><strong>Output:</strong></p><div class="codeblock3"><pre>
Addition of two matrices: [2 1 2]
                          [6 8 7]
                          [2 7 4]
</pre></div><p><a href="program-to-calculate-the-subtraction-of-two-matrices">2) Program to calculate the subtraction of 2 matrices</a></p><p><strong>Input:</strong></p><div class="codeblock"><div class="dp-highlighter"><div class="bar"><div class="tools"> </div></div><ol class="dp-xml" start="1"><li class="alt"><span><span>Matrix </span><span class="attribute">a</span><span> = [4, 5, 6]  </span></span></li><li><span>           [3, 4, 1]  </span></li><li class="alt"><span>           [1, 2, 3]  </span></li><li><span>  </span></li><li class="alt"><span>Matrix <span class="attribute">b</span><span> = [2, 0, 3]  </span></span></li><li><span>           [2, 3, 1]  </span></li><li class="alt"><span>           [1, 1, 1]  </span></li></ol></div><textarea class="xml" name="code" style="display:none">Matrix a = [4, 5, 6]
