                             [0 1 2]
</pre></div><p><a href="program-to-determine-whether-a-given-matrix-is-an-identity-matrix">3) Program to determine whether a given matrix is an identity matrix</a></p><p><strong>Input:</strong></p><div class="codeblock"><div class="dp-highlighter"><div class="bar"><div class="tools"> </div></div><ol class="dp-xml" start="1"><li class="alt"><span><span>Matrix </span><span class="attribute">a</span><span> =[1, 0, 0]  </span></span></li><li><span>          [0, 1, 0]  </span></li><li class="alt"><span>          [0, 0, 1]  </span></li></ol></div><textarea class="xml" name="code" style="display:none">Matrix a =[1, 0, 0]
