" src="https://d2jdgazzki9vjm.cloudfront.net/programs/images/pattern-program-10.png"><p><a href="program-to-print-pattern-11">11) Program to Print Following Pattern</a></p><p>A<br/>B B<br/>C C C<br/>D D D D<br/>E E E E E</p><p><a href="program-to-print-pattern-12">12) Program to Print Following Pattern</a></p><img alt="Program To Print Following Pattern" src="https://d2jdgazzki9vjm.cloudfront.net/programs/images/pattern-program-12.png"/><p><a href="program-to-print-pattern-13">13) Program to Print Following Pattern</a></p><p>1 2 3 4 5<br/>1 2 3 4<br/>1 2 3<br/>1 2<br/>1</p><p><a href="program-to-print-pattern-14">14) Program to Print Following Pattern</a></p><img alt="Program To Print Following Pattern" src="https://d2jdgazzki9vjm.cloudfront.net/programs/images/pattern-program-14.png"/><p><a href="program-to-print-pattern-15">15) Program to Print Following Pattern</a></p><img alt="Program To Print Following Pattern" src="https://d2jdgazzki9vjm.cloudfront.net/programs/images/pattern-program-15.png"/><p><a href="program-to-print-pattern-16">16) Program to Print Following Pattern</a></p><img alt="Program To Print Following Pattern" src="https://d2jdgazzki9vjm.cloudfront.net/programs/images/pattern-program-16.png"/><p><a href="program-to-print-pattern-17">17) Program to Print Following Pattern</a></p><p>1<br/>2 3<br/>4 5 6<br/>7 8 9 10</p><p><a href="program-to-print-pattern-18">18) Program to Print Following Pattern</a></p><p>1<br/>1 2<br/>1 2 3<br/>1 2 3 4<br/>1 2 3 4 5</p><p><a href="program-to-print-pattern-19">19) Program to Print Following Pattern</a></p><img alt="Program To Print Following Pattern" src="https://d2jdgazzki9vjm.cloudfront.net/programs/images/pattern-program-19.png"/><hr/><h2 class="h2padding" id="tree">Tree Programs</h2><p><a href="program-to-calculate-the-difference-between-the-sum-of-the-odd-level-and-even-level-nodes-of-a-binary-tree">1) Program to Calculate the Difference Between the Sum of the Odd Level and Even Level Nodes of a Binary Tree</a></p><p><strong>Input:</strong></p><img alt="Program to Calculate the Difference Between the Sum of the Odd Level and Even Level Nodes of a Binary Tree" src="https://d2jdgazzki9vjm.cloudfront.net/programs/images/calculate-the-difference-between-the-sum-of-the-odd-level-and-even-level-nodes-of-a-binary-tree-program.png"/><p><strong>Output:</strong></p><div class="codeblock3"><pre>
OddLevelSum = 1 + 4 + 5 + 6 = 16
